<DocsLayout title="Keybindings">
  <p>MarkRust uses platform-standard modifier keys. See <a href="/docs/shortcuts">Keyboard shortcuts</a> for the full list.</p>

  <h2>Customization</h2>
  <p>Custom keybinding configuration is deferred. Shortcuts are currently fixed in the application; the previous version-specific promise is no longer a release commitment.</p>

  <h2>Platform conventions</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>macOS:</strong> Command (⌘) for file operations and editing</li>
    <li><strong>Windows / Linux:</strong> Ctrl for equivalent actions; native GUI acceptance is pending for these experimental platforms.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Find is <kbd>⌘F</kbd> / <kbd>Ctrl+F</kbd>. Open Location is <kbd>⌘⇧L</kbd> / <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+L</kbd>. Theme switching uses <kbd>⌘⌥⇧T</kbd> / <kbd>Ctrl+Alt+Shift+T</kbd>, leaving the conventional Reopen Closed Tab chord unassigned.</p>
  <h2>Related</h2>
  <p><a href="/docs/shortcuts">Keyboard shortcuts</a> · <a href="/docs/search">Search</a></p>
</DocsLayout>
